\newlabel{fig:seed497}{{7}{41}{Cumulative costs (top) and daily disruption counts (bottom) for Myopic and CFA under value-based zone selection, seed~497 (single run). The dashed vertical line marks day~9, where the gap widens most sharply. Myopic total: €\,52{,}491; CFA total: €\,37{,}191.\relax }{figure.caption.9}{}}
